<title>CHINA: China's Jan-March coal imports down by 65.5 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-March coal imports down by 65.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 300,000 tonnes of coal in the first three months of 1997, down by 65.5 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal     300,000		 50,000	-65.5</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-MARCH     MARCH  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal    6,190,000	    2,040,000     +40.3</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
